</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9F06013001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear end door license garnish. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9806008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect connector (1), and then remove rearview camera (3) while releasing locks (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFJA0P9F0026.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "62.289mm" ver = "02" gw = "214" gh = "160"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9F06013002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure.
</ptxt>
